# The AutoLootPacksProbe moves the player, so a room-description box can open
# first (the Winding Corridor one on a loaded old save, none on a built
# character): the @while closes it only when it is there. The macro's loot menu
# then gets SPACE (mark the one item) and ENTER; a "too large" notice is closed
# by SPACE; ESC leaves any inventory screen.
@while "Winding Corridor" SPACE
SPACE
ENTER
@while "too large" SPACE
ESC*10
@quit
